# 必考词 Unit 09 短语

## 常考短语

- **in dispute**: 在争论中 — The ownership of the land is still in dispute. 土地所有权仍在争论中。
- **beyond dispute**: 无可争辩 — His talent is beyond dispute. 他的才华无可争辩。
- **distinguish...from**: 把…与…区分开 — It's hard to distinguish fact from fiction. 很难区分事实和虚构。
- **distribute...to/among**: 把…分配给 — The funds were distributed among the research teams. 资金被分配给了各研究团队。
- **a diverse range of**: 多种多样的 — The store offers a diverse range of products. 商店提供多种多样的产品。
- **domestic affairs**: 国内事务 — The president focused on domestic affairs. 总统专注于国内事务。
- **dominant position**: 主导地位 — The company holds a dominant position in the market. 公司在市场上占据主导地位。
- **donate...to**: 把…捐给 — He donated blood to the hospital. 他向医院献血。
- **a dose of**: 一剂；一点 — She needs a dose of reality. 她需要一点现实的打击。
- **in draft**: 在草拟中 — The contract is still in draft. 合同仍在草拟中。
- **take drastic measures**: 采取严厉措施 — The government took drastic measures to control inflation. 政府采取了严厉措施控制通胀。
- **eager to do sth**: 渴望做某事 — She is eager to start her new job. 她渴望开始新工作。
- **elaborate on**: 详细阐述 — Please elaborate on your plan. 请详细阐述你的计划。
- **embrace change**: 拥抱变化 — Successful companies embrace change. 成功的公司拥抱变化。
- **place emphasis on**: 强调，重视 — The curriculum places emphasis on critical thinking. 课程强调批判性思维。
